    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Exploration】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>In the world of Lord of Mysteries, you can explore the 【Order World】 in various maps, as well as the 【City Dark Side】 gameplay in Tingen. Participating in the gameplay increases the completion of the Order World and the bounty value of the City Dark Side, allowing you to claim generous progress rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Entrance Guide:</>\n1. TRPG Entrance\nOpen the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any sect, and then enter the 【Order World】 or 【City Dark Side】. Select the corresponding gameplay or event and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n2. Map Entrance\nOpen the map in the top right corner, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, and select to enter the 【Order World】 or 【City Dark Side】. Then select the gameplay or event you want to experience and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended:</>{JumpToUI:Tingen Exploration Collection|1301900}, {JumpToUI:Golden Autumn Lake Exploration Collection|1301901}, {JumpToUI:Lamud Castle Exploration Collection|1301902}, {JumpToUI:Water Lily Town Exploration Collection|1301903}, {JumpToUI:Hornacis Mountains Exploration Collection|1301904}, {JumpToUI:Hornacis Flower Sea Exploration Collection|1301905}\n<Assistant_Title2>Exploration Tips:</>\n{SendAnswer:1. Spirituality Leap|882}: During exploration, you can long-press the jump button to enter the spirituality leap state; click the jump button again to leap higher!\n{SendAnswer:2. Spirit Vision|883}: Click the spirit vision button to enter the spirit vision state, where you can discover nearby treasure chests, quest clues, and interactive puzzle points."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Исследование】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Инструкции:</>В мире Повелитель Тайн вы можете исследовать 【Мир Порядка】 на различных картах, а также игровой процесс 【Темной стороны города】 в Тингене. Участие в игровом процессе увеличивает завершение Мира Порядка и ценность награды Темной стороны города, что позволяет вам 